# The Library rail's tiles look and play as Arc 1.174's (its rules, read from its code). The page shown
# has the label colour at 10 % behind it, its label whole and its icon in the theme's two colours; the
# others have a label and icon lines at 70 % and nothing inside; the pointer puts 5 % behind a tile and
# changes nothing else; a pressed tile's wash draws in 2 pt all round. Picking a page plays its icon once,
# from frame 1 to its selection's end (35; Boosts 45), over a run of frames, and the page left behind
# shows nothing playing. The ink is white on a dark theme and black on a light one. A short window
# shrinks the tiles and then drops their labels.

cra://action/viewMedia
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryRail=media&as=shown
expect-log library rail shown: media frame=1 frames=[0-9]+ selected=yes tile=97x80 label=shown tip=none wash=(FFFFFF|000000)/0\.085 washSize=97x80 ink=(FFFFFF|000000)/0\.850 lines=[0-9A-F]{6}/1\.000 inside=[0-9A-F]{6}/1\.000
cra://debug?libraryRail=downloads&as=rest
expect-log library rail rest: downloads frame=1 frames=[0-9]+ selected=no tile=97x80 label=shown tip=none wash=(FFFFFF|000000)/0\.000 washSize=97x80 ink=(FFFFFF|000000)/0\.595 lines=[0-9A-F]{6}/0\.700 inside=none

# The pointer: the wash, and nothing else.
cra://debug?libraryRail=downloads&hover=1&as=hover
expect-log library rail hover: downloads frame=1 frames=[0-9]+ selected=no tile=97x80 label=shown tip=none wash=(FFFFFF|000000)/0\.043 washSize=97x80 ink=(FFFFFF|000000)/0\.595 lines=[0-9A-F]{6}/0\.700 inside=none
cra://debug?libraryRail=downloads&hover=0&as=left
expect-log library rail left: downloads frame=1 .* wash=(FFFFFF|000000)/0\.000

# Pressed: the wash alone draws in.
cra://debug?libraryRail=spaces&press=1&as=down
expect-log library rail down: spaces frame=1 .* washSize=93x76
cra://debug?libraryRail=spaces&press=0&as=up
expect-log library rail up: spaces frame=1 .* washSize=97x80

# Picked: the icon plays to selection-end in many frames (a jump would be one or two).
cra://action/viewDownloads
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryRail=downloads&as=picked
expect-log library rail picked: downloads frame=35 frames=([2-9][0-9]|[1-9][0-9]{2,}) selected=yes tile=97x80 label=shown tip=none wash=(FFFFFF|000000)/0\.085 .* inside=[0-9A-F]{6}/1\.000
cra://debug?libraryRail=media&as=dropped
expect-log library rail dropped: media frame=1 frames=[0-9]+ selected=no tile=97x80 label=shown tip=none wash=(FFFFFF|000000)/0\.000 .* inside=none

# Boosts' selection is the longer one.
cra://action/viewBoosts
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryRail=boosts&as=boosts
expect-log library rail boosts: boosts frame=45 frames=([2-9][0-9]|[1-9][0-9]{2,}) selected=yes

# A window too short for 100 pt a page: the tiles shrink, and at 64 pt or less they drop their labels
# and name their page in a tooltip instead (Arc's small style).
cra://debug?windowSize=1100x440
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryRail=media&as=short
expect-log library rail short: media frame=1 .* tile=97x59 label=dropped tip=Media
cra://debug?windowSize=1100x800
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryRail=media&as=tall
expect-log library rail tall: media frame=1 .* tile=97x80 label=shown tip=none
